 (The Humanoid). It is a collaboration between Studio 4&deg;C, Shirogumi, and American filmmaker Rashad Haughton, with art direction by Tatsuyuki Tanaka. The CG animation was created \"by eye,\" using filmed sequences with live actors as reference models.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 7}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 6, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Sci-Fi"], "tags": [{"name": "Robots", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Space", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Heterosexual", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Aliens", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 17359, "title": {"romaji": "Peeping Life: The Perfect Explosion", "english": null}, "format": "OVA", "description": "Another iteration in the Peeping Life franchise.", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 10}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2012, "episodes": 10, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy", "Slice of Life"], "tags": []}, {"id": 17573, "title": {"romaji": "Planetarium Uchuu Kyoudai: Itten no Hikari", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "The anime's original story features Mutta and Hibito during one summer when they were children. During the summer when Mutta and Hibito made their promise to go to space, they met a young girl who also had a wish.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 7}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2012, "episodes": 1, "duration": 38, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy", "Sci-Fi", "Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "Seinen", "rank": 50, "isAdult"